1
00:00:00,897 --> 00:00:02,197
♪

2
00:00:03,067 --> 00:00:04,157
Oh.

3
00:00:04,487 --> 00:00:06,117
Hey, Suzuki! What's up?

4
00:00:06,157 --> 00:00:08,407
Oh, hey, good morning, Azuma!

5
00:00:08,487 --> 00:00:10,697
[AZUMA] Is that the yeti
from that new movie?

6
00:00:10,747 --> 00:00:13,287
Uh-huh! My little fluffball.

7
00:00:13,327 --> 00:00:14,917
So, who'd you see it with?

8
00:00:14,997 --> 00:00:17,587
You go with Nabe or Satou?

9
00:00:17,627 --> 00:00:19,127
No, uh...

10
00:00:19,747 --> 00:00:21,047
with Tani.

11
00:00:21,337 --> 00:00:22,467
[AZUMA] Hm?

12
00:00:23,007 --> 00:00:25,927
- Tani? Why'd he go with you?
- [Suzuki muttering]

13
00:00:26,007 --> 00:00:29,177
- Mmm... Mmm...
- 'Cause we're dating.

14
00:00:30,427 --> 00:00:33,727
- What? And you didn't tell me?
- Oopsies, my b!

15
00:00:33,767 --> 00:00:35,727
That's all you have to say,
"my b?"

16
00:00:35,767 --> 00:00:37,517
Start talking.
When did this happen?

17
00:00:37,557 --> 00:00:38,767
Recently.

18
00:00:38,857 --> 00:00:40,437
And how did this happen?

19
00:00:40,477 --> 00:00:42,897
- Uh, well.
- Who asked who out?

20
00:00:42,937 --> 00:00:44,107
It was, uh...

21
00:00:44,147 --> 00:00:45,777
[gasps] Blackmail?

22
00:00:45,857 --> 00:00:47,447
[SUZUKI] Are you ever
gonna let me talk, or...

23
00:00:49,277 --> 00:00:51,447
Oh, my God, girl.

24
00:00:51,487 --> 00:00:54,077
- Oh, my God...
- Are you happy

25
00:00:54,117 --> 00:00:55,617
or about to have a breakdown?

26
00:00:55,667 --> 00:00:56,957
The former.

27
00:00:57,037 --> 00:01:00,087
But I'm also, like,
insanely jealous right now.

28
00:01:00,127 --> 00:01:03,297
The two of you are so sweet,
it is making me physically ill.

29
00:01:03,337 --> 00:01:04,377
Thanks I guess?

30
00:01:04,417 --> 00:01:06,217
Hey, why are you
so calm right now?

31
00:01:06,257 --> 00:01:07,387
Are you not freaking out?

32
00:01:07,427 --> 00:01:09,387
You're confused.
Tani's the calm one.

33
00:01:09,427 --> 00:01:11,597
Wait, serious people attract
serious people.

34
00:01:11,637 --> 00:01:12,967
Are you a serious person?

35
00:01:13,057 --> 00:01:15,307
How did I not notice?
Is my whole life a lie?

36
00:01:15,347 --> 00:01:17,187
[SUZUKI] Um, are you good?

37
00:01:17,437 --> 00:01:20,477
Yeah, just wish I could find
a guy who has it together.

38
00:01:20,517 --> 00:01:22,397
My last ex totally ghosted me

39
00:01:22,437 --> 00:01:24,317
with absolutely
zero warning one day.

40
00:01:24,357 --> 00:01:25,447
But then I found out

41
00:01:25,777 --> 00:01:27,947
it was 'cause he got thrown
into juvie, so, yeah.

42
00:01:27,987 --> 00:01:30,777
Wouldn't exactly say
it was my finest hour.

43
00:01:31,117 --> 00:01:33,447
But whatever, that's just love.

44
00:01:33,487 --> 00:01:35,957
Girly, that is not "just love."

45
00:01:37,167 --> 00:01:39,167
[YAMADA] You see any
good movies lately, Taira?

46
00:01:39,207 --> 00:01:40,957
Nah, I don't like
theater crowds.

47
00:01:40,997 --> 00:01:43,627
They're either too loud
or too quiet, no in-between.

48
00:01:43,667 --> 00:01:45,667
[YAMADA] Funny, Gapacho said
the same thing.

49
00:01:45,717 --> 00:01:46,917
But the new one
with the witch

50
00:01:46,967 --> 00:01:48,797
and the fluffy guy
might be worth the risk!

51
00:01:48,797 --> 00:01:50,297
- That's what you wanna see?
- [SUZUKI] Come on now,

52
00:01:50,347 --> 00:01:51,297
don't give up!

53
00:01:51,717 --> 00:01:52,807
- What if the right person's...
- Here comes Suzuki.

54
00:01:52,847 --> 00:01:54,177
I know that screech.

55
00:01:54,217 --> 00:01:56,177
Nah, unfortunately,
I've got a type

56
00:01:56,227 --> 00:01:58,137
and it's toxic tools
across the board.

57
00:01:58,187 --> 00:02:00,227
I meet someone,
I think he's the one,

58
00:02:00,267 --> 00:02:01,397
boom... psychopath.

59
00:02:01,437 --> 00:02:03,937
Heavy stuff.
We just got here.

60
00:02:03,977 --> 00:02:05,987
It's never too early
to lift up our friends

61
00:02:06,027 --> 00:02:07,197
and help them find romance!

62
00:02:07,237 --> 00:02:08,657
Come on, Azuma, tell him!

63
00:02:08,697 --> 00:02:11,027
Maybe dying alone
is what I deserve

64
00:02:11,117 --> 00:02:12,737
