It's science.

69
00:02:20,877 --> 00:02:23,127
We get it, no one wanted
to date you in middle school.

70
00:02:23,127 --> 00:02:25,207
Now hold on. Is the man wrong?

71
00:02:25,247 --> 00:02:27,257
Dudes who are rough
around the edges are so hot!

72
00:02:28,217 --> 00:02:30,007
They've got that "I'm damaged,
fix me" rizz,

73
00:02:30,047 --> 00:02:31,137
