74
00:02:31,297 --> 00:02:33,347
[AZUMA] You are down
horrendous for SudaKen.

75
00:02:33,387 --> 00:02:35,347
- [Suzuki chuckles]
- [TAIRA] Dating is all about

76
00:02:35,387 --> 00:02:37,477
