the social hierarchy.

77
00:02:37,517 --> 00:02:39,347
It doesn't matter
what's on the inside,

78
00:02:39,387 --> 00:02:42,857
it's about finding a partner
who can raise your position.

79
00:02:42,857 --> 00:02:44,857
[TAIRA] People want
someone at the top

80
00:02:44,857 --> 00:02:46,647
of the attractiveness
pecking order.

81
00:02:46,687 --> 00:02:48,237
And once they land
that someone,

82
00:02:48,277 --> 00:02:50,357
it boosts them up
a few rungs themselves.

83
00:02:50,407 --> 00:02:51,567
[SUZUKI] SudaKen,
my bodacious...

84
00:02:52,027 --> 00:02:53,867
- [TAIRA] It's all so stupid.
- Better get the squirt bottle.

85
00:02:53,907 --> 00:02:56,237
Hey, Suzuki,
should you be saying that?

86
00:02:56,287 --> 00:02:58,497
I mean, Tani's right there.

87
00:02:58,537 --> 00:03:00,577
[screams]

88
00:03:02,417 --> 00:03:04,627
- Tani, hi, how's your desk?
- [Watanabe and Yamada laugh]

89
00:03:04,667 --> 00:03:06,167
- Hello.
- [SATOU] Damage control mode.

90
00:03:06,167 --> 00:03:08,877
So, hey, uh, did you hear
our whole convo?

91
00:03:08,917 --> 00:03:10,047
Yes, I heard it all,

92
00:03:10,087 --> 00:03:12,007
but nothing you said
bothered me.

93
00:03:12,047 --> 00:03:14,547
Look at her, she's so cute
when she's spiraling.

94
00:03:14,597 --> 00:03:16,677
Everybody shut up,
my show is on.

95
00:03:16,717 --> 00:03:17,767
Here we go.

96
00:03:17,807 --> 00:03:19,767
Hey, am I missing something?

97
00:03:19,807 --> 00:03:20,887
Oh.

98
00:03:21,057 --> 00:03:22,347
Yeah, those guys
are a couple now.

99
00:03:23,307 --> 00:03:24,397
[TAIRA] Huh?

100
00:03:24,897 --> 00:03:27,687
Wait, how come everyone else
is acting normal?

101
00:03:27,727 --> 00:03:29,187
Nobody finds this weird?

102
00:03:29,187 --> 00:03:31,197
Maybe they reacted differently

103
00:03:31,197 --> 00:03:32,407
when they first found out.

104
00:03:32,447 --> 00:03:33,907
- Are you okay?
- [TAIRA] Someone must've

105
00:03:33,907 --> 00:03:34,947
grabbed her by the shoulders

106
00:03:35,027 --> 00:03:36,947
and screamed "Why him," right?

107
00:03:37,027 --> 00:03:39,077
He really doesn't seem
like her type.

108
00:03:39,117 --> 00:03:41,117
[SUZUKI] SudaKen,
be still my heart!

109
00:03:41,207 --> 00:03:43,287
[SUZUKI] I want a dangerous,
dominant...

110
00:03:43,327 --> 00:03:44,497
[TAIRA] The gap between
her fantasy

111
00:03:44,537 --> 00:03:47,127
and her reality
is a million miles wide.

112
00:03:47,207 --> 00:03:48,207
[SUZUKI]
...beefcake chorus line.

113
00:03:48,297 --> 00:03:50,377
Greetings, my dude.
How's it hangin'?

114
00:03:50,417 --> 00:03:51,667
[TANI] Good morning.

115
00:03:51,967 --> 00:03:54,087
[TAIRA] And why's Yamada
acting like the two of them

116
00:03:54,137 --> 00:03:55,967
