117
00:03:56,427 --> 00:03:58,637
- Whoa! A fluffy!
- [Suzuki exclaiming]

118
00:03:58,677 --> 00:04:00,137
OMG, we match!

119
00:04:00,217 --> 00:04:02,847
- I smell a waft of love stank!
- [TANI] Love stank?

120
00:04:02,937 --> 00:04:05,687
Oh, that reminds me,
did you take any pics?

121
00:04:05,727 --> 00:04:07,647
Uh, no, what even are those?

122
00:04:07,687 --> 00:04:09,527
- Okay, liar.
- We took one.

123
00:04:09,567 --> 00:04:10,857
Et tu, Tani?

124
00:04:10,937 --> 00:04:13,357
- Hey, I wanna see!
- [WATANABE] Show me! Show me!

125
00:04:13,397 --> 00:04:16,867
