127
00:05:50,327 --> 00:05:52,877
[Taira groans]
It's so hot today.

128
00:05:53,337 --> 00:05:55,087
I need a drink.

129
00:05:55,167 --> 00:05:56,217
Uh?

130
00:05:57,507 --> 00:05:59,637
Are you trying
to beat the heat too?

131
00:05:59,677 --> 00:06:00,887
[TAIRA] Hey, Suzuki.

132
00:06:01,177 --> 00:06:03,507
