a Reality Gold Strong.

133
00:06:03,557 --> 00:06:05,267
Your girl just
cleaned them all out.

134
00:06:05,347 --> 00:06:06,847
[TAIRA] Have at it.
I don't drink that garbage.

135
00:06:06,887 --> 00:06:09,227
Oh, but the fizzies.

136
00:06:12,977 --> 00:06:14,437
Hey, tell me something.

137
00:06:14,647 --> 00:06:15,857
[SUZUKI] Mm?

138
00:06:15,897 --> 00:06:18,197
- Why'd you pick Tani?
- [gasps]

139
00:06:19,067 --> 00:06:20,237
My first love triangle!

140
00:06:21,237 --> 00:06:23,487
What? Good lord, no.
What is wrong with you?

141
00:06:23,527 --> 00:06:25,077
I just don't understand it.

142
00:06:25,117 --> 00:06:26,787
It'd be one thing if Yamada

143
00:06:26,827 --> 00:06:28,707
or Watanabe dated
someone like him.

144
00:06:28,747 --> 00:06:30,877
Those two don't give
a crap. But you?

145
00:06:30,917 --> 00:06:32,417
You're obsessed with
what everyone thinks of you.

146
00:06:32,457 --> 00:06:34,957
Oh, my God. Is that what
everyone thinks of me?

147
00:06:34,997 --> 00:06:38,507
And yet, you're dating someone
on the opposite wavelength.

148
00:06:38,547 --> 00:06:39,587
It's weird.

149
00:06:41,677 --> 00:06:42,927
[Suzuki chuckles]

150
00:06:43,757 --> 00:06:46,387
[SUZUKI] Yeah, you're right
that I always worry

151
00:06:46,387 --> 00:06:47,727
about what others think.

152
00:06:47,767 --> 00:06:50,597
I work my butt off to fit in
and drive myself crazy

153
00:06:50,647 --> 00:06:52,477
wondering if people like me.

154
00:06:52,517 --> 00:06:54,767
But, hey, maybe that explains

155
00:06:54,817 --> 00:06:57,277
