going for someone like Tani.

156
00:06:57,317 --> 00:06:58,947
I'm a peeps pleaser,

157
00:06:58,987 --> 00:07:02,487
whereas Tani is strictly himself
no matter what the peeps think.

158
00:07:05,737 --> 00:07:08,117
Uh... oops,

159
00:07:08,787 --> 00:07:10,157
word vomit.

160
00:07:10,997 --> 00:07:12,877
You really have to hear
the whole story

161
00:07:12,917 --> 00:07:14,417
to get why I'm like this.

162
00:07:14,457 --> 00:07:15,997
You got a couple hours?

163
00:07:16,047 --> 00:07:18,877
[TAIRA] Only if you've got
a cyanide capsule for me.

164
00:07:18,917 --> 00:07:20,507
[Suzuki laughs]

165
00:07:23,257 --> 00:07:25,717
[TANI] This window seat's
frying me alive.

166
00:07:25,757 --> 00:07:26,717
[Tani gasps]

167
00:07:26,757 --> 00:07:28,427
Heya!

168
00:07:28,467 --> 00:07:31,347
[chuckles] I've always wanted
to do that to someone!

169
00:07:31,437 --> 00:07:33,147
Were you shooketh?

170
00:07:33,147 --> 00:07:34,647
Yes, I was.

171
00:07:34,687 --> 00:07:35,857
You don't look shooketh.

172
00:07:35,897 --> 00:07:37,187
[TAIRA] Seriously,

173
00:07:37,357 --> 00:07:40,067
they're already doing
stereotypical couple things?

174
00:07:40,147 --> 00:07:42,987
I bought us drinks to cool off,
which one do you want?

175
00:07:43,027 --> 00:07:44,447
Papa or baby?

176
00:07:44,487 --> 00:07:46,277
[TAIRA] Why'd she get
two of the same thing?

177
00:07:46,327 --> 00:07:48,537
- [TANI] Baby, please.
- [TAIRA] Ah, how chivalrous.

178
00:07:48,577 --> 00:07:49,577
How much was it?

179
00:07:49,617 --> 00:07:51,617
You don't need
to pay me back, silly!

180
00:07:51,657 --> 00:07:52,707
Oh, you sure?

181
00:07:52,957 --> 00:07:54,827
Of course I am. Come on,
do I look that broke?

182
00:07:54,877 --> 00:07:56,287
[TAIRA] And now
I'm eavesdropping on them

183
00:07:56,337 --> 00:07:57,877
- like a total chud.
- [SUZUKI] But if you insist,

184
00:07:57,917 --> 00:07:59,837
- three yen!
- [TANI] I don't need a discount.

185
00:07:59,877 --> 00:08:00,967
[Taira groans]

186
00:08:01,167 --> 00:08:03,757
[TAIRA] Aren't they
just two peas in a pod?

187
00:08:03,797 --> 00:08:04,757
[screams]

188
00:08:04,797 --> 00:08:06,507
So how was
your drink pilgrimage?

189
00:08:06,547 --> 00:08:08,597
- What the eff?
- I accidentally left my water

190
00:08:08,637 --> 00:08:09,717
in the freezer for too long,

191
00:08:10,057 --> 00:08:12,177
so now I'm bashin' it
to try and get it to thaw out.

192
00:08:12,177 --> 00:08:15,097
Can you test out Mjolnir
somewhere else, please?

193
00:08:15,187 --> 00:08:16,557
[YAMADA] Suzuki!

194
00:08:16,607 --> 00:08:18,017
What do you want now?

195
00:08:18,067 --> 00:08:19,187
Homework, please!

196
00:08:19,227 --> 00:08:20,737
You're so lame!

197
00:08:20,777 --> 00:08:23,317
Do your own homework.
This is getting stupid.

198
00:08:23,357 --> 00:08:24,657
[cries]

199
00:08:24,697 --> 00:08:26,527
- Tani?
- Don't you dare!

200
00:08:26,567 --> 00:08:29,117
Are you sure you don't wanna
take a look at mine?

201
00:08:29,197 --> 00:08:31,867
I mean, I have already
completed the assignment.

202
00:08:31,907 --> 00:08:34,827
[TAIRA] Oh, great, now they're
gonna exploit the poor guy

203
00:08:34,867 --> 00:08:36,377
for his intelligence?

204
00:08:36,377 --> 00:08:38,707
Just know you won't learn
anything this way,

205
00:08:38,747 --> 00:08:39,877
okay?

206
00:08:42,667 --> 00:08:44,337
I can live with that.

207
00:08:44,377 --> 00:08:47,047
[SUZUKI] Well, I can't!
Hands off, you little leech!

208
00:08:47,717 --> 00:08:50,257
[TAIRA] Suzuki really
does like Tani.

209
00:08:50,347 --> 00:08:51,967
That much is obvious.

210
00:08:52,017 --> 00:08:53,927
Everyone understands
it's her choice,

211
00:08:53,977 --> 00:08:55,347
so they're just cool with it.

212
00:08:55,387 --> 00:08:56,767
- Leave him alone, dude!
- Give it here, bestie!

213
00:08:56,807 --> 00:08:57,767
[overlapping chatter]

214
00:08:57,807 --> 00:08:58,807
[TAIRA]
They're not even worried

215
00:08:58,937 --> 00:09:01,107
about what other people
will think.

216
00:09:01,147 --> 00:09:03,817
You can take your sob story
and shove it up your blowhole!

217
00:09:03,857 --> 00:09:05,067
Dude, get off!

218
00:09:05,107 --> 00:09:07,027
[TAIRA]
Wait, maybe that's it.

219
00:09:07,067 --> 00:09:08,027
[bell chimes]

220
00:09:08,367 --> 00:09:09,867
[TAIRA] I was so sure
I'd never get it,

221
00:09:09,907 --> 00:09:12,947
but I think I kinda do.

222
00:09:12,997 --> 00:09:14,407
Nice. I'll have to
check them out!

223
00:09:14,867 --> 00:09:16,167
[TAIRA]
It really messed me up

224
00:09:16,247 --> 00:09:18,247
to see someone I considered
an afterthought

225
00:09:18,287 --> 00:09:20,377
